1
00:01:36,700 --> 00:01:38,930
[The Lament of Autumn]

2
00:01:39,470 --> 00:01:41,910
[Episode 31]

3
00:02:17,460 --> 00:02:18,960
Restore our sovereignty!

4
00:02:19,060 --> 00:02:20,400
Restore our sovereignty!

5
00:02:20,400 --> 00:02:24,160
[Uphold Our Neutrality]
[Give Us Back Our Shandong Homeland]

6
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:21,960
Restore our sovereignty!

7
00:02:22,930 --> 00:02:24,400
Japan declared war on Germany,

8
00:02:24,400 --> 00:02:25,690
but used it as an excuse

9
00:02:26,030 --> 00:02:28,030
to land troops at Longkou in Shandong!

10
00:02:28,030 --> 00:02:29,690
They ignored our neutrality,

11
00:02:29,900 --> 00:02:31,120
brazenly invaded our land,

12
00:02:31,120 --> 00:02:33,690
[Uphold Our Neutrality]
[Give Us Back Our Shandong Homeland]

13
00:02:31,180 --> 00:02:32,800
and trampled on our motherland!

14
00:02:32,800 --> 00:02:33,860
Restore our sovereignty!

15
00:02:33,860 --> 00:02:35,120
Restore our sovereignty!

16
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:37,630
-Restore our sovereignty!
-Restore our sovereignty!

17
00:02:37,630 --> 00:02:39,130
Restore our sovereignty!

18
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,710
What are you trying to do?

19
00:02:40,710 --> 00:02:42,620
The Japanese government has generously

20
00:02:42,620 --> 00:02:43,310
helped your backward,

21
00:02:43,310 --> 00:02:45,620
ignorant country build railways

22
00:02:45,650 --> 00:02:47,190
and even allowed you to study

23
00:02:47,190 --> 00:02:49,060
advanced knowledge and technology here.

24
00:02:49,060 --> 00:02:50,410
Yet instead of showing gratitude,

25
00:02:50,410 --> 00:02:51,750
you spread vicious slander!

26
00:02:51,750 --> 00:02:52,910
Get out of here!

27
00:03:27,810 --> 00:03:29,140
Stop!

28
00:03:33,690 --> 00:03:34,500
This assembly

29
00:03:35,370 --> 00:03:37,410
was approved by the school in advance.

30
00:03:37,410 --> 00:03:39,310
It's reasonable, proper,
and completely legal.

31
00:03:39,310 --> 00:03:40,620
If you want to cause trouble,

32
00:03:40,620 --> 00:03:42,280
take it up with the principal.

33
00:03:42,500 --> 00:03:43,810
And what if we do?

34
00:03:43,810 --> 00:03:44,860
You think the principal

35
00:03:44,860 --> 00:03:47,260
will take your side over ours?
You Chinese?

36
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,460
You may bully

37
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:54,060
a foreign student who's far from home

38
00:03:54,060 --> 00:03:55,460
and standing alone.

39
00:03:55,620 --> 00:03:57,220
But if you dare to look down on

40
00:03:57,450 --> 00:03:58,910
a nation with 5,000 years of civilization

41
00:03:58,910 --> 00:04:00,250
and 400 million people,

42
00:04:00,900 --> 00:04:01,620
I guarantee you'll pay

43
00:04:01,620 --> 00:04:02,740
a terrible price.

44
00:04:03,190 --> 00:04:03,910
And when exactly

45
00:04:03,910 --> 00:04:04,930
will we pay?

46
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:05,970
Come on!

47
00:04:06,780 --> 00:04:07,970
I can't wait!

48
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:11,250
I swear on my life,

49
00:04:12,650 --> 00:04:13,500
you will.

50
00:04:15,750 --> 00:04:17,250
Then prove it.

51
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:18,500
Let's go.

52
00:04:20,190 --> 00:04:21,010
Thank you

53
00:04:21,120 --> 00:04:22,380
for standing up for us.

54
00:04:22,690 --> 00:04:23,750
We're all Chinese.

55
00:04:24,390 --> 00:04:25,850
We should stand together.

56
00:04:26,330 --> 00:04:27,130
That's right.

57
00:04:28,060 --> 00:04:29,520
We should stand together.

58
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,580
You're hurt pretty badly.

59
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:34,450
Let's get you to the infirmary.

60
00:04:34,690 --> 00:04:35,500
I'm okay.

61
00:04:37,190 --> 00:04:38,010
Who are you?

62
00:04:38,370 --> 00:04:39,360
Nice moves.

63
00:04:39,420 --> 00:04:40,500
My name is Yu Mingxuan.

64
00:04:40,500 --> 00:04:42,360
I only arrived in Japan recently.

65
00:04:42,390 --> 00:04:43,810
No wonder I've never seen you before.

66
00:04:43,810 --> 00:04:45,370
It's okay
we didn't know each other before.

67
00:04:45,370 --> 00:04:47,370
From now on, we're in this together.

68
00:04:57,860 --> 00:04:58,659
Mingxuan.

69
00:05:00,510 --> 00:05:02,770
"I urge you to drink
one last cup of wine."

70
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:04,800
From tomorrow on,

71
00:05:05,620 --> 00:05:06,540
I'll have

72
00:05:08,370 --> 00:05:09,770
no kindred spirits here.

73
00:05:15,390 --> 00:05:16,190
Zhongfang.

74
00:05:18,060 --> 00:05:19,620
Though mountains and rivers
may lie between us,

75
00:05:19,620 --> 00:05:20,680
we shall meet again

76
00:05:21,660 --> 00:05:22,660
I promise you,

77
00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:24,380
when we return,

78
00:05:24,630 --> 00:05:26,160
whatever lies ahead,

79
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:27,500
my resolve

80
00:05:29,750 --> 00:05:30,750
will never waver.

81
00:05:31,810 --> 00:05:32,890
To save our nation

82
00:05:33,850 --> 00:05:35,050
and serve our people,

83
00:05:35,880 --> 00:05:37,920
we shall never yield, no matter the odds.

84
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:39,180
A promise is a promise.

85
00:05:42,220 --> 00:05:44,150
I'll be waiting for you in Nanhuai.

86
00:05:44,740 --> 00:05:45,630
It's a deal.

87
00:05:45,920 --> 00:05:46,810
It's a deal.

88
00:05:55,310 --> 00:05:56,220
It was a promise

89
00:05:56,220 --> 00:05:57,450
you made yourself.

90
00:05:59,690 --> 00:06:01,550
How could you forget it so easily?

91
00:06:04,300 --> 00:06:05,800
Ever since I met you,

92
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:12,520
you've always been this way.

93
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,190
You gave

94
00:06:20,510 --> 00:06:22,970
without ever asking for anything
in return.

95
00:06:23,420 --> 00:06:25,820
I've always wanted to do something
for you,

96
00:06:27,010 --> 00:06:30,140
but with your privileged background,
your popularity,

97
00:06:31,330 --> 00:06:34,530
and your outstanding
academic achievements,

98
00:06:36,890 --> 00:06:37,570
I really didn't know

99
00:06:37,570 --> 00:06:39,370
what I could possibly do for you—

100
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:44,659
until I found your diary

101
00:06:47,010 --> 00:06:48,690
after you passed away.

102
00:06:50,190 --> 00:06:51,250
November 17th.

103
00:06:52,060 --> 00:06:54,659
The cold in Tokyo has grown more bitter
of late.

104
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:57,500
Nearly all the leaves have fallen
from the trees in the courtyard.

105
00:06:57,500 --> 00:06:58,680
November 25th.

106
00:06:58,890 --> 00:07:00,330
I received a letter from Lan Qing.

107
00:06:59,490 --> 00:07:01,760
[November 25th]

108
00:07:00,770 --> 00:07:02,190
She says all is well,

109
00:07:02,830 --> 00:07:03,800
but I know

110
00:07:04,570 --> 00:07:06,010
she must have risen early

111
00:07:06,010 --> 00:07:07,930
to practice her voice again,
heedless of the cold.

112
00:07:07,930 --> 00:07:10,990
She didn't mention a word
about her cough in the letter.

113
00:07:11,390 --> 00:07:12,980
I cannot help but worry.

114
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:21,010
I had someone bring this back from abroad.

115
00:07:23,310 --> 00:07:25,040
It's the brand you used to take.

116
00:07:27,220 --> 00:07:28,220
February 5th.

117
00:07:28,800 --> 00:07:31,180
I spent the evening
drinking and talking with Zhongfang.

118
00:07:31,180 --> 00:07:33,540
As I walked the streets of Tokyo
at daybreak,

119
00:07:33,540 --> 00:07:36,270
I thought of the garden balsam
Lan Qing loves so dearly.

120
00:07:36,270 --> 00:07:37,800
It, too, sprouts in spring,

121
00:07:37,860 --> 00:07:39,120
flourishes in summer,

122
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:40,770
and withers within a single season.

123
00:07:40,770 --> 00:07:42,560
All things in this world are as fleeting
as dew or lightning.

124
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:44,630
In the end, everything must pass away.

125
00:07:44,630 --> 00:07:45,540
Yet life

126
00:07:45,770 --> 00:07:47,950
continues to grow even as it fades.

127
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:50,130
8th Day of Early Summer.

128
00:07:50,159 --> 00:07:52,600
The book club's activities have grown
increasingly demanding.

129
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:54,310
In a recent letter from Mother,

130
00:07:54,310 --> 00:07:57,240
she mentioned that Changxuan
had quarreled with Father again.

131
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:58,900
His birthday is drawing near,

132
00:07:59,310 --> 00:08:01,910
and I cannot help
but think of him with concern.

133
00:08:01,930 --> 00:08:02,600
I wonder if our family

134
00:08:02,600 --> 00:08:04,510
has made arrangements to celebrate it.

135
00:08:04,510 --> 00:08:06,030
He has always liked pocket watches.

136
00:08:06,030 --> 00:08:07,310
Before returning to Nanhuai,

137
00:08:07,310 --> 00:08:09,620
I must visit a watch shop
and choose one for him.

138
00:08:09,620 --> 00:08:11,350
I'll give him the watch he likes

139
00:08:11,540 --> 00:08:13,120
for his birthday.

140
00:08:13,300 --> 00:08:16,300
Fifth Young Master Yu,
this is a birthday gift for you.

141
00:08:23,190 --> 00:08:23,690
Jin.

142
00:08:24,370 --> 00:08:24,890
How did you know

143
00:08:24,890 --> 00:08:26,220
I liked pocket watches?

144
00:08:31,810 --> 00:08:34,289
Chatting with Zhongfang
these past few days,

145
00:08:34,289 --> 00:08:36,690
I've come to find him
even more intriguing.

146
00:08:36,870 --> 00:08:38,240
He shows absolutely no interest

147
00:08:37,710 --> 00:08:40,960
[Jin Zhongfang]

148
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,549
in the fame, fortune, and status

149
00:08:39,549 --> 00:08:41,809
that most people chase after so eagerly.

150
00:08:42,630 --> 00:08:43,370
Sometimes I feel

151
00:08:43,370 --> 00:08:44,630
I understand him well,

152
00:08:45,300 --> 00:08:48,140
[Jin Zhongfang]

153
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:48,500
yet at other times, I can't seem to
figure him out at all.

154
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:51,250
For instance, when it comes to
what he actually likes,

155
00:08:51,250 --> 00:08:53,710
I can't seem to put my finger on it
right away.

156
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:57,200
Mingxuan.

157
00:08:58,220 --> 00:08:59,500
My favorite thing

158
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:01,340
is listening to you talk enthusiastically

159
00:09:01,340 --> 00:09:02,440
about your ideals.

160
00:09:03,500 --> 00:09:04,300
Zhongfang!

161
00:09:05,290 --> 00:09:06,620
Zhongfang, great news!

162
00:09:06,860 --> 00:09:08,460
Absolutely fantastic news!

163
00:09:09,130 --> 00:09:09,820
It's begun!

164
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,910
The Southwest has taken up arms!

165
00:09:11,910 --> 00:09:12,460
Look!

166
00:09:13,940 --> 00:09:14,600
Just today,

167
00:09:14,770 --> 00:09:16,770
the Southwestern commanders
issued a telegram to the whole nation,

168
00:09:16,770 --> 00:09:17,940
declaring the Southwest's independence

169
00:09:17,940 --> 00:09:19,080
and organizing
the National Protection Army

170
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:20,740
to march against Yuan Shikai!

171
00:09:21,050 --> 00:09:22,380
Will they really overthrow Yuan Shikai?

172
00:09:22,380 --> 00:09:23,100
Of course!

173
00:09:23,540 --> 00:09:24,340
They've sworn

174
00:09:24,460 --> 00:09:26,410
to fight for the dignity
of our 400 million people.

175
00:09:26,410 --> 00:09:27,650
That usurper's dream
of becoming emperor

176
00:09:27,650 --> 00:09:28,850
will never come true!

177
00:09:28,940 --> 00:09:30,580
Our 400 million people won't stand for it!

178
00:09:30,580 --> 00:09:32,020
Our republic isn't dead!

179
00:09:32,150 --> 00:09:34,150
There's still hope for our country!

180
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:37,010
That's wonderful!

181
00:09:37,010 --> 00:09:38,210
Our country is saved!

182
00:10:16,940 --> 00:10:17,840
Who are you?

183
00:10:18,390 --> 00:10:19,790
My name is Jin Zhongfang,

184
00:10:21,370 --> 00:10:23,230
and I'm a classmate of Yu Mingxuan

185
00:10:24,270 --> 00:10:25,530
from his time in Japan.

186
00:10:37,750 --> 00:10:38,810
He's right inside.

187
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:57,500
[Memorial Tablet of My Late Brother,
Yu Mingxuan]

188
00:11:07,610 --> 00:11:11,270
[Memorial Tablet of My Late Brother,
Yu Mingxuan]

189
00:11:39,550 --> 00:11:40,360
Mingxuan.

190
00:11:41,100 --> 00:11:42,910
I'll fulfill every one of

191
00:11:44,220 --> 00:11:46,280
your unfulfilled dreams and ideals.

192
00:12:19,740 --> 00:12:21,700
Look how eager he is—

193
00:12:21,770 --> 00:12:24,100
as if someone's going to
steal it from him.

194
00:12:25,270 --> 00:12:26,410
Good boy, Zening.

195
00:12:26,750 --> 00:12:28,480
Zening, you're eating so well.

196
00:12:31,130 --> 00:12:31,790
Pingjun.

197
00:12:32,530 --> 00:12:33,730
Come on, give it a try.

198
00:12:33,950 --> 00:12:34,410
Come on.

199
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:36,440
Support his head with your hand.

200
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:37,110
Be careful.

201
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:40,860
Bring that hand

202
00:12:41,010 --> 00:12:41,530
up.

203
00:12:43,670 --> 00:12:44,030
Here.

204
00:12:51,770 --> 00:12:53,980
Jinxuan, he's really eating.

205
00:12:54,650 --> 00:12:56,500
I told you. You can do it.

206
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:02,480
Take it slow.

207
00:13:05,980 --> 00:13:06,630
Jinxuan.

208
00:13:06,890 --> 00:13:08,290
Is he going to cry?

209
00:13:08,290 --> 00:13:10,150
It's okay. Pat him with your hand.

210
00:13:10,370 --> 00:13:11,220
Pat gently.

211
00:13:11,860 --> 00:13:12,750
Pat gently.

212
00:13:12,790 --> 00:13:13,480
Right.

213
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:15,000
Talk to him.

214
00:13:15,250 --> 00:13:15,940
Okay.

215
00:13:16,790 --> 00:13:18,010
Good boy, Zening.

216
00:13:19,600 --> 00:13:20,390
Good boy.

217
00:13:22,100 --> 00:13:23,890
Eat up.

218
00:13:24,550 --> 00:13:26,050
Good boy, Zening.

219
00:13:27,650 --> 00:13:28,790
Good boy, Zening.

220
00:13:56,690 --> 00:13:59,430
It's so late. Aren't you going to sleep?

221
00:14:00,530 --> 00:14:03,530
I need a little more time.
You go ahead and sleep first.

222
00:14:09,750 --> 00:14:12,290
What, can't sleep without me?

223
00:14:18,650 --> 00:14:20,380
I'm not talking to you anymore.

224
00:15:00,860 --> 00:15:02,290
Don't mess with me.

225
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:04,550
You sleep,

226
00:15:05,780 --> 00:15:06,910
and I'll do my thing.

227
00:15:57,870 --> 00:15:58,500
Seeing

228
00:15:58,500 --> 00:15:59,770
how happy you were

229
00:16:00,960 --> 00:16:02,160
holding Zening today

230
00:16:04,340 --> 00:16:05,400
made me realize...

231
00:16:07,340 --> 00:16:08,910
I want a child of our own,

232
00:16:10,720 --> 00:16:12,410
one who looks like both you

233
00:16:13,250 --> 00:16:14,630
and me.

234
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:27,740
What are you doing?

235
00:17:29,660 --> 00:17:30,450
Nothing.

236
00:17:30,790 --> 00:17:32,920
I got a longevity lock for Zening

237
00:17:33,570 --> 00:17:34,500
to keep him safe.

238
00:17:36,330 --> 00:17:38,530
He's too little to wear it yet.

239
00:17:39,480 --> 00:17:41,280
Then keep it for when he's older.

240
00:17:46,290 --> 00:17:47,310
Zening's eyes

241
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:49,000
and nose

242
00:17:49,400 --> 00:17:50,730
look so much like yours.

243
00:17:53,290 --> 00:17:55,960
Of course my child takes after me.

244
00:18:01,110 --> 00:18:02,640
I'm glad he takes after you.

245
00:18:53,180 --> 00:18:54,830
Why isn't Uncle back yet?

246
00:18:56,310 --> 00:18:57,900
Mr. Tang and Commander Mu

247
00:18:57,900 --> 00:18:59,140
are discussing official business.

248
00:18:59,140 --> 00:19:00,800
They must not be finished yet.

249
00:19:08,270 --> 00:19:09,530
That day at the lounge,

250
00:19:10,500 --> 00:19:11,200
thank you.

251
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:14,350
It was nothing.

252
00:19:14,750 --> 00:19:15,610
No matter what,

253
00:19:16,700 --> 00:19:18,160
you got hurt because of me.

254
00:19:19,880 --> 00:19:22,200
Next time I run into you,
Second Young Lady Tao,

255
00:19:22,200 --> 00:19:23,730
I'll pretend not to see you.

256
00:19:25,500 --> 00:19:26,380
What's that supposed to mean?

257
00:19:26,380 --> 00:19:27,580
You said it yourself.

258
00:19:28,200 --> 00:19:29,000
Your affairs

259
00:19:30,010 --> 00:19:32,010
are none of anyone else's business.

260
00:19:33,030 --> 00:19:33,400
I...

261
00:19:33,400 --> 00:19:34,400
Please. This way.

262
00:19:37,220 --> 00:19:39,410
I could hear you two chatting
away from a mile off.

263
00:19:39,410 --> 00:19:40,350
You sound like

264
00:19:41,030 --> 00:19:42,350
a bickering couple.

265
00:19:43,030 --> 00:19:43,830
Uncle.

266
00:19:44,500 --> 00:19:46,270
Mr. Tang, Commander Mu.

267
00:19:46,680 --> 00:19:47,480
Xueting,

268
00:19:48,420 --> 00:19:50,220
what were you two talking about?

269
00:19:50,770 --> 00:19:53,160
You didn't make upset
Second Young Lady, did you?

270
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:53,720
Come on, sit.

271
00:19:53,720 --> 00:19:54,650
I wouldn't dare.

272
00:19:58,750 --> 00:20:00,550
A Steinway like this is a rare find.

273
00:20:00,550 --> 00:20:02,410
Did you just buy it, Commander Mu?

274
00:20:02,530 --> 00:20:03,220
It was just delivered

275
00:20:03,220 --> 00:20:04,200
a few days ago

276
00:20:04,200 --> 00:20:05,460
on Dr. Tang's merchant ship.

277
00:20:05,460 --> 00:20:06,660
It's been sitting there unused.

278
00:20:06,660 --> 00:20:09,050
Why don't you guys give it a try
and see how it sounds?

279
00:20:09,050 --> 00:20:09,960
Go ahead. Go on.

280
00:20:10,050 --> 00:20:10,850
Sure.

281
00:20:11,220 --> 00:20:11,750
Let's go.

282
00:20:55,460 --> 00:20:57,260
I can't quite remember the rest.

283
00:20:58,530 --> 00:21:00,660
You're the better pianist, after all.

284
00:21:01,140 --> 00:21:03,160
Brahms' "Hungarian Dances" are indeed

285
00:21:03,160 --> 00:21:05,690
hard to play from memory
without sheet music.

286
00:21:06,790 --> 00:21:07,500
Xueting,

287
00:21:08,220 --> 00:21:09,000
you play the piano

288
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:10,460
quite well, too.

289
00:21:10,640 --> 00:21:13,330
Why not play a duet
with Second Young Lady?

290
00:21:17,110 --> 00:21:18,850
Since Mr. Tang and Commander Mu

291
00:21:18,850 --> 00:21:20,160
are in such high spirits,

292
00:21:20,160 --> 00:21:21,560
I'll do my best to oblige.

293
00:23:28,250 --> 00:23:29,250
Come on, sit down.

294
00:23:31,270 --> 00:23:32,250
Pingjun.

295
00:23:36,050 --> 00:23:38,050
How come you've lost so much weight?

296
00:23:39,460 --> 00:23:40,180
I'm okay.

297
00:23:40,920 --> 00:23:41,880
The doctor said

298
00:23:42,460 --> 00:23:44,460
withdrawal takes a toll on the body,

299
00:23:45,160 --> 00:23:48,890
but I'll regain my strength with
some rest and proper nourishment.

300
00:23:49,140 --> 00:23:49,870
Come on, sit.

301
00:23:56,380 --> 00:23:57,160
Pingjun.

302
00:24:01,850 --> 00:24:02,640
I'm sorry.

303
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:09,590
I hurt you so badly before,

304
00:24:11,090 --> 00:24:13,420
yet you put it all behind you
and helped me.

305
00:24:14,680 --> 00:24:15,790
Don't say that.

306
00:24:17,070 --> 00:24:18,400
It's all in the past now.

307
00:24:25,140 --> 00:24:26,740
I asked you to come here today

308
00:24:28,530 --> 00:24:30,110
to give you this.

309
00:24:30,700 --> 00:24:33,230
It symbolizes completeness and perfection,

310
00:24:34,160 --> 00:24:35,790
a good omen.

311
00:24:38,000 --> 00:24:39,930
It's my blessing for the two of you.

312
00:24:44,530 --> 00:24:47,400
Thank you. I really like it.

313
00:24:48,400 --> 00:24:49,660
I'm glad you like it.

314
00:24:52,660 --> 00:24:53,550
Pingjun.

315
00:24:54,920 --> 00:24:58,200
Actually, I really envy you.

316
00:24:59,610 --> 00:25:02,850
Not everyone in this world

317
00:25:02,850 --> 00:25:04,080
is lucky enough

318
00:25:04,460 --> 00:25:05,590
to spend their life

319
00:25:05,590 --> 00:25:07,050
with the person they love.

320
00:25:10,180 --> 00:25:11,500
Lan Qing...

321
00:25:12,310 --> 00:25:14,110
You don't need to worry about me.

322
00:25:15,480 --> 00:25:17,050
I once thought

323
00:25:18,090 --> 00:25:19,550
I'd never be lucky enough

324
00:25:19,700 --> 00:25:21,550
to find the right man

325
00:25:22,420 --> 00:25:24,090
and build a life with him.

326
00:25:26,110 --> 00:25:26,900
But after

327
00:25:26,900 --> 00:25:28,530
coming so close to death,

328
00:25:29,500 --> 00:25:30,560
I finally realized

329
00:25:31,900 --> 00:25:32,900
that Mingxuan...

330
00:25:36,810 --> 00:25:38,550
He's always been right here,

331
00:25:39,110 --> 00:25:42,460
watching over me, protecting me.

332
00:25:45,030 --> 00:25:48,830
So I'll take care of myself

333
00:25:50,340 --> 00:25:51,780
and live on,

334
00:25:52,090 --> 00:25:53,690
carrying his memory with me.

335
00:26:03,480 --> 00:26:04,330
Look.

336
00:26:07,030 --> 00:26:08,690
The flowers and trees outside

337
00:26:09,330 --> 00:26:10,570
wither and fade

338
00:26:11,050 --> 00:26:12,680
once winter arrives,

339
00:26:14,440 --> 00:26:15,770
but when spring comes,

340
00:26:17,330 --> 00:26:19,030
they sprout and bloom again.

341
00:26:21,940 --> 00:26:23,420
Enduring the bitter cold

342
00:26:25,790 --> 00:26:27,010
leads to new life.

343
00:26:36,590 --> 00:26:37,330
So,

344
00:26:38,380 --> 00:26:40,380
what are your plans from here on out?

345
00:26:47,590 --> 00:26:49,110
I want to leave Nanhuai.

346
00:26:50,810 --> 00:26:53,070
I want to go to Beijing

347
00:26:53,770 --> 00:26:55,070
or Guangzhou

348
00:26:57,110 --> 00:27:01,330
to see new plays and new sights.

349
00:27:04,610 --> 00:27:06,350
When I return,

350
00:27:07,480 --> 00:27:10,140
I'll definitely be able to
perform even better.

351
00:27:16,960 --> 00:27:17,460
Okay.

352
00:27:31,900 --> 00:27:33,190
Higher, higher.

353
00:27:33,940 --> 00:27:34,250
Hurry up.

354
00:27:34,250 --> 00:27:35,720
The guests are arriving soon.

355
00:27:35,720 --> 00:27:37,500
Hang it a bit higher on this side too.

356
00:27:37,290 --> 00:27:40,560
[Vision and Wisdom Beyond Measure]

357
00:27:38,140 --> 00:27:40,800
Move the table over here
and put it in the middle.

358
00:27:41,960 --> 00:27:43,690
Fruits. Bring the fruits over.

359
00:27:44,030 --> 00:27:45,290
You two, hurry up.

360
00:27:46,310 --> 00:27:47,770
What are you guys waiting for?

361
00:27:47,770 --> 00:27:48,770
Hurry over there.

362
00:27:52,820 --> 00:27:55,760
[Vision and Wisdom Beyond Measure]

363
00:27:53,900 --> 00:27:54,960
Careful. Careful.

364
00:27:55,610 --> 00:27:55,960
Okay.

365
00:28:26,880 --> 00:28:28,410
What are you embroidering?

366
00:28:28,750 --> 00:28:30,550
You've been at it all afternoon.

367
00:28:37,270 --> 00:28:39,000
I embroidered this for Zening.

368
00:28:39,160 --> 00:28:40,770
What do you think? Is it cute?

369
00:28:42,790 --> 00:28:44,590
You did a nice job on that kitten.

370
00:28:46,880 --> 00:28:48,700
What kitten?

371
00:28:50,480 --> 00:28:52,530
It's clearly a little tiger.

372
00:28:54,240 --> 00:28:55,330
A little tiger?

373
00:28:55,960 --> 00:28:57,250
Looks more like

374
00:28:57,250 --> 00:28:59,790
a feral kitten with its claws out.

375
00:29:22,350 --> 00:29:23,410
Just like this one.

376
00:29:42,940 --> 00:29:43,980
The way you bite

377
00:29:44,810 --> 00:29:46,870
really does have that feral cat vibe.

378
00:29:59,160 --> 00:30:01,030
Then you'd better watch out.

379
00:30:02,820 --> 00:30:04,430
Even a feral kitten

380
00:30:06,050 --> 00:30:08,110
can be as fierce as a tiger sometimes.

381
00:30:20,720 --> 00:30:22,520
I advise you, Fifth Young Madam,

382
00:30:23,550 --> 00:30:24,750
not to play with fire.

383
00:30:33,500 --> 00:30:34,830
But I want to.

384
00:30:36,160 --> 00:30:37,960
What are you going to do about it?

385
00:30:39,790 --> 00:30:41,480
Fifth Young Master Yu,

386
00:30:44,310 --> 00:30:46,570
are you going to give me a court-martial?

387
00:31:11,740 --> 00:31:12,570
Let go of me.

388
00:31:19,980 --> 00:31:20,880
Looks like you need

389
00:31:20,880 --> 00:31:22,480
to be taught a proper lesson.

390
00:31:25,460 --> 00:31:26,260
What's wrong?

391
00:31:28,050 --> 00:31:29,690
You're hurting me.

392
00:31:29,790 --> 00:31:30,850
Where does it hurt?

393
00:31:40,440 --> 00:31:41,350
I still have to go play mahjong

394
00:31:41,350 --> 00:31:43,150
with Mother and make mooncakes.

395
00:32:05,680 --> 00:32:06,540
Not bad, right?

396
00:32:07,410 --> 00:32:08,650
Jinxuan, Jinxuan.

397
00:32:08,680 --> 00:32:10,380
What do you think of this one I made?

398
00:32:10,380 --> 00:32:11,110
Not bad.

399
00:32:11,110 --> 00:32:12,380
But put less sugar.

400
00:32:12,500 --> 00:32:14,500
Father and Mother don't like it too sweet.

401
00:32:14,500 --> 00:32:15,810
Got it. I'll eat this one then.

402
00:32:15,810 --> 00:32:16,420
Okay.

403
00:32:16,830 --> 00:32:17,980
Zening,

404
00:32:18,090 --> 00:32:19,900
look what they're doing.

405
00:32:19,900 --> 00:32:20,940
Look.

406
00:32:21,110 --> 00:32:21,940
Zening.

407
00:32:29,720 --> 00:32:30,520
White Dragon.

408
00:32:33,780 --> 00:32:35,250
Bingwen, what do you think of

409
00:32:35,250 --> 00:32:36,750
Commander's hand?

410
00:32:43,200 --> 00:32:45,140
Father always has everything
under control.

411
00:32:45,140 --> 00:32:46,960
A mahjong game is no different
from a battle.

412
00:32:46,960 --> 00:32:48,720
Victory is assured.

413
00:32:50,240 --> 00:32:53,100
Are you complaining
that I haven't lost enough yet?

414
00:33:01,070 --> 00:33:02,110
Fifth Young Madam.

415
00:33:02,110 --> 00:33:04,570
Can't decide what to discard again,
can you?

416
00:33:04,720 --> 00:33:05,880
You need someone

417
00:33:05,880 --> 00:33:07,420
standing behind you

418
00:33:07,480 --> 00:33:09,620
to give you a few pointers.

419
00:33:10,440 --> 00:33:11,370
Father, Mother.

420
00:33:13,420 --> 00:33:14,720
Talking about perfect timing—

421
00:33:14,720 --> 00:33:17,070
your strategist has arrived.

422
00:33:22,420 --> 00:33:24,180
Let Bingwen take over for a while.

423
00:33:24,180 --> 00:33:25,700
I'll take you out for a walk.

424
00:33:25,700 --> 00:33:27,470
Leaving right after winning?

425
00:33:27,810 --> 00:33:29,270
That's not very sporting.

426
00:33:30,010 --> 00:33:31,310
See? Father said that.

427
00:33:31,510 --> 00:33:33,830
Besides, I still have half a round to go.

428
00:33:34,530 --> 00:33:35,720
Alright, go on.

429
00:33:35,720 --> 00:33:36,810
Otherwise, someone's mind

430
00:33:36,810 --> 00:33:38,740
will be wandering off anyway.

431
00:33:39,240 --> 00:33:40,770
I'm stealing her away then.

432
00:33:41,220 --> 00:33:42,620
Otherwise, if we team up,

433
00:33:42,880 --> 00:33:44,570
who knows how much we'll win from you?

434
00:33:44,570 --> 00:33:45,240
Let's go.

435
00:33:45,810 --> 00:33:47,270
We'll be off then, Mother.

436
00:33:48,220 --> 00:33:49,010
Bingwen.

437
00:33:49,240 --> 00:33:50,300
Take over for a bit.

438
00:33:52,980 --> 00:33:53,770
Changxuan.

439
00:33:54,030 --> 00:33:55,240
You're so biased.

440
00:33:55,240 --> 00:33:57,170
Why don't you take me out for some fun?

441
00:33:57,170 --> 00:33:58,480
Just make your mooncakes.

442
00:33:58,480 --> 00:34:00,660
Eat more. Look how skinny you are.

443
00:34:00,810 --> 00:34:01,510
I've told you before,

444
00:34:01,510 --> 00:34:03,310
don't pat me on the head anymore!

445
00:34:05,270 --> 00:34:07,530
Zening, look, aren't they fun?

446
00:34:08,920 --> 00:34:13,260
Bravo! Bravo!

447
00:34:18,960 --> 00:34:24,670
Bravo! Bravo!

448
00:34:28,170 --> 00:34:29,550
Bravo! Bravo!

449
00:34:30,670 --> 00:34:32,010
Step right up, folks!

450
00:34:32,010 --> 00:34:33,670
Come on over and try your luck!

451
00:34:33,860 --> 00:34:35,190
Come pop some balloons!

452
00:34:35,460 --> 00:34:36,650
Let's see how good

453
00:34:36,650 --> 00:34:37,980
this young man's aim is.

454
00:34:43,840 --> 00:34:45,040
Just a little bit off.

455
00:34:45,230 --> 00:34:46,320
Aim carefully.

456
00:34:47,500 --> 00:34:48,360
Let's see.

457
00:34:48,630 --> 00:34:49,550
Second shot.

458
00:34:51,300 --> 00:34:54,260
[Hall of Heavenly Kings]

459
00:34:52,030 --> 00:34:53,230
Nice shot! Nice shot!

460
00:34:54,530 --> 00:34:56,670
This guy's got some skills after all.

461
00:34:57,900 --> 00:34:58,760
Aim carefully.

462
00:35:01,460 --> 00:35:02,550
Just missed by a hair.

463
00:35:02,550 --> 00:35:03,340
Forget it. Let's go.

464
00:35:03,340 --> 00:35:06,650
-This guy's not good enough.
-Wait. Let me think of something.

465
00:35:06,650 --> 00:35:07,210
Boss,

466
00:35:08,030 --> 00:35:09,030
could I just

467
00:35:09,100 --> 00:35:10,810
[First Prize]

468
00:35:09,530 --> 00:35:10,890
buy one of those porcelain dolls?

469
00:35:10,890 --> 00:35:11,700
[Shoot 10 Shots as You Please]

470
00:35:11,480 --> 00:35:12,410
Hold on, hold on.

471
00:35:12,610 --> 00:35:15,120
That would be cheating.

472
00:35:15,760 --> 00:35:17,420
I've run this stall for years.

473
00:35:17,480 --> 00:35:19,730
We can't break the rules,

474
00:35:19,730 --> 00:35:20,570
can we?

475
00:35:20,570 --> 00:35:22,010
Look, if you two

476
00:35:21,680 --> 00:35:24,500
[Shoot 10 Shots as You Please]

477
00:35:22,010 --> 00:35:23,550
really like that doll,

478
00:35:23,780 --> 00:35:24,980
why not play another round?

479
00:35:24,980 --> 00:35:25,820
Right?

480
00:35:25,840 --> 00:35:27,530
One yuan per shot.

481
00:35:27,650 --> 00:35:30,170
Hit 5 out of 10, and you win a prize.

482
00:35:27,980 --> 00:35:31,320
[Shoot 10 Shots as You Please]

483
00:35:30,500 --> 00:35:31,670
Hit 7,

484
00:35:32,070 --> 00:35:32,860
and you can take home

485
00:35:32,860 --> 00:35:34,660
our grand prize, the lucky doll!

486
00:35:35,210 --> 00:35:36,720
Who else wants to try?

487
00:35:36,740 --> 00:35:38,120
1 yuan per shot!

488
00:35:38,210 --> 00:35:39,000
Anyone?

489
00:35:40,420 --> 00:35:41,650
What if I hit all 10?

490
00:35:43,210 --> 00:35:45,780
All 10? Now that's a tall order.

491
00:35:45,960 --> 00:35:47,380
I've run this stall for years,

492
00:35:47,380 --> 00:35:48,300
and no one's ever

493
00:35:48,300 --> 00:35:50,110
hit all 10.

494
00:35:51,780 --> 00:35:52,580
Changxuan...

495
00:35:53,190 --> 00:35:54,030
Sir,

496
00:35:54,380 --> 00:35:56,370
if you manage to hit all 10 today,

497
00:35:56,530 --> 00:35:58,460
you can take home every grand prize

498
00:35:58,530 --> 00:35:59,760
at my stall.

499
00:35:59,820 --> 00:36:00,680
How about that?

500
00:36:04,130 --> 00:36:05,630
See that doll?

501
00:36:05,880 --> 00:36:07,510
If we bring it home for Zening,

502
00:36:07,290 --> 00:36:08,730
[First Prize]

503
00:36:07,550 --> 00:36:08,840
he'll like it, right?

504
00:36:09,740 --> 00:36:10,740
Give it a try then.

505
00:36:11,780 --> 00:36:12,840
Alright, I'll try.

506
00:36:13,610 --> 00:36:15,190
Alright, let's see how good

507
00:36:15,190 --> 00:36:16,420
this young master's aim really is.

508
00:36:16,420 --> 00:36:17,960
Is he as good as he claims?

509
00:36:19,960 --> 00:36:21,560
Make sure you aim carefully!

510
00:36:25,760 --> 00:36:27,000
That's a hit! That's a hit!

511
00:36:27,000 --> 00:36:27,960
So impressive.

512
00:36:33,170 --> 00:36:34,900
He's amazing, 5 hits in a row!

513
00:36:34,920 --> 00:36:36,610
Yeah, so impressive!

514
00:36:38,250 --> 00:36:40,180
Young master, please go easy on me.

515
00:36:40,960 --> 00:36:42,300
How about this?

516
00:36:42,630 --> 00:36:44,230
If you really like that doll,

517
00:36:44,340 --> 00:36:46,400
I'll give you one for free, all right?

518
00:36:47,530 --> 00:36:49,480
That's not what you said just now.

519
00:36:51,860 --> 00:36:52,840
That won't do.

520
00:36:53,360 --> 00:36:54,760
Weren't you the one who said

521
00:36:54,760 --> 00:36:56,220
we had to follow the rules?

522
00:36:56,800 --> 00:36:58,000
Rules are rigid,

523
00:36:58,000 --> 00:36:59,260
but we can be flexible,

524
00:36:59,280 --> 00:36:59,800
right?

525
00:37:03,360 --> 00:37:04,380
Six!

526
00:37:04,940 --> 00:37:06,230
Seven!

527
00:37:07,110 --> 00:37:08,440
Eight!

528
00:37:09,630 --> 00:37:10,780
Nine!

529
00:37:13,930 --> 00:37:15,480
Ten!

530
00:37:16,230 --> 00:37:17,380
That's amazing!

531
00:37:17,460 --> 00:37:18,550
So impressive!

532
00:37:19,900 --> 00:37:21,130
Incredible!

533
00:37:21,690 --> 00:37:22,860
What a sharpshooter!

534
00:37:22,860 --> 00:37:24,420
Yeah, that's amazing!

535
00:37:26,190 --> 00:37:26,920
Young Master.

536
00:37:26,920 --> 00:37:28,960
Please go easy on me.

537
00:37:29,070 --> 00:37:30,800
I'm just running a small business here.

538
00:37:30,800 --> 00:37:32,530
If you take all these prizes,

539
00:37:32,730 --> 00:37:33,860
I'll lose

540
00:37:33,860 --> 00:37:35,770
everything I've made today.

541
00:37:36,190 --> 00:37:37,900
Please, have mercy.

542
00:37:47,090 --> 00:37:47,900
Thank you.

543
00:37:49,440 --> 00:37:50,230
It's so cute.

544
00:37:53,190 --> 00:37:53,840
Let's go.

545
00:37:57,380 --> 00:37:58,170
Look at them.

546
00:37:59,690 --> 00:38:00,590
Mr. Yu, I didn't realize that

547
00:38:00,590 --> 00:38:01,980
besides being a good shot,

548
00:38:01,980 --> 00:38:03,580
you're also so considerate.

549
00:38:10,730 --> 00:38:13,930
Have you only just discovered
how wonderful I am, my lady?

550
00:38:21,920 --> 00:38:23,580
Help yourself to any of these.

551
00:38:31,190 --> 00:38:31,850
Here you go.

552
00:39:01,460 --> 00:39:03,120
Taste it and see if it's sweet.

553
00:39:10,800 --> 00:39:11,400
Is it good?

554
00:39:13,130 --> 00:39:13,860
So sweet.

555
00:39:22,370 --> 00:39:23,000
Hold this.

556
00:40:09,980 --> 00:40:12,420
I'm done drying it. I want to go to bed.

557
00:40:25,860 --> 00:40:27,120
If you don't dry it now,

558
00:40:27,530 --> 00:40:29,390
you'll have a headache tomorrow.

559
00:40:44,670 --> 00:40:46,870
Stop fussing. It'll just take a moment.

560
00:41:02,920 --> 00:41:04,980
Your injuries from the explosion

561
00:41:05,840 --> 00:41:07,570
have almost healed.

562
00:41:13,780 --> 00:41:14,920
Does it still hurt?

563
00:41:35,550 --> 00:41:36,610
These past few days

564
00:41:39,260 --> 00:41:40,630
have felt like a dream.

565
00:41:43,010 --> 00:41:44,480
Sometimes, it all feels

566
00:41:46,110 --> 00:41:47,380
so unreal.

567
00:42:42,150 --> 00:42:43,210
What about now?

568
00:42:45,920 --> 00:42:47,690
Does it still feel like a dream?

569
00:44:12,260 --> 00:44:15,830
[Discipline Committee]

570
00:44:15,730 --> 00:44:16,390
Changxuan.

571
00:44:16,960 --> 00:44:18,320
The central government
has specially sent Inspector Gao

572
00:44:18,320 --> 00:44:19,320
to our Nanhuai,

573
00:44:19,360 --> 00:44:20,820
supposedly to inspect our defenses.

574
00:44:20,820 --> 00:44:22,820
Who knows what they're really up to?

575
00:44:23,380 --> 00:44:24,180
You know what?

576
00:44:24,210 --> 00:44:25,230
That Gao Ping

577
00:44:25,590 --> 00:44:26,860
is the deputy director

578
00:44:27,000 --> 00:44:28,090
of the Central Military
and Political Affairs Bureau,

579
00:44:28,090 --> 00:44:30,260
and word is
he's been very much in favor lately.

580
00:44:30,260 --> 00:44:32,620
Just last month, he was specially awarded

581
00:44:32,690 --> 00:44:34,090
an imported Buick,

582
00:44:34,190 --> 00:44:36,130
complete with a personal chauffeur.

583
00:44:36,130 --> 00:44:36,930
And he was also

584
00:44:36,980 --> 00:44:38,500
given a large mansion

585
00:44:38,500 --> 00:44:39,760
as an additional reward.

586
00:44:39,760 --> 00:44:41,360
Now that he's a regular
at the Premier's Residence,

587
00:44:41,360 --> 00:44:43,690
his influence has been growing by the day.

588
00:44:43,840 --> 00:44:44,780
With an imperial envoy like him

589
00:44:44,780 --> 00:44:46,610
riding so high,

590
00:44:48,480 --> 00:44:50,680
I'm afraid he won't be easy to deal with.

591
00:44:53,500 --> 00:44:54,300
How about

592
00:44:55,440 --> 00:44:58,040
I find an excuse
so we don't have to receive him?

593
00:44:58,190 --> 00:44:59,520
He's already on his way.

594
00:44:59,860 --> 00:45:01,120
If we brush him off now,

595
00:45:01,190 --> 00:45:02,900
we'll give the central government grounds

596
00:45:02,900 --> 00:45:04,430
to accuse us of disloyalty.

597
00:45:04,730 --> 00:45:05,990
Then what should we do?

598
00:45:07,650 --> 00:45:10,030
Let's wait until he arrives
and see how things play out.

599
00:45:10,030 --> 00:45:12,960
Just make sure we observe
all the proper courtesies.

600
00:45:21,640 --> 00:45:23,310
[Xiangxi Hotel]

601
00:45:30,070 --> 00:45:32,820
Pingjun, when Inspector Gao arrives,

602
00:45:33,050 --> 00:45:34,480
I'll have to go entertain him.

603
00:45:34,480 --> 00:45:36,210
Mrs. Zhang and Mrs. Gu are here.

604
00:45:36,440 --> 00:45:37,880
They're both very fond of you.

605
00:45:37,880 --> 00:45:38,420
You can have tea

606
00:45:38,420 --> 00:45:39,820
and chat with them.

607
00:45:41,010 --> 00:45:42,010
Don't worry.

608
00:45:44,900 --> 00:45:46,630
The Commander-in-Chief has been

609
00:45:46,630 --> 00:45:48,230
patrolling Beigang lately,

610
00:45:49,090 --> 00:45:51,620
yet Inspector Gao has chosen
this very moment

611
00:45:51,670 --> 00:45:52,760
to visit Nanhuai.

612
00:45:53,260 --> 00:45:54,760
He claims it's an inspection,

613
00:45:54,760 --> 00:45:57,000
but I suspect he has other motives.

614
00:45:57,730 --> 00:46:00,900
The Revolutionary Army has taken
several cities in a row.

615
00:46:00,900 --> 00:46:03,590
The central government
is probably making plans

616
00:46:03,590 --> 00:46:05,650
to squeeze money out of every region.

617
00:46:06,530 --> 00:46:09,060
Whatever the central government
has in mind,

618
00:46:09,090 --> 00:46:11,820
we'll do everything we can
to support Changxuan.

619
00:46:12,400 --> 00:46:14,000
For now, let's keep this high-and-mighty

620
00:46:14,000 --> 00:46:15,330
Inspector Gao in check.

621
00:46:17,980 --> 00:46:20,980
Inspector Gao of the central government
has arrived!

622
00:46:50,110 --> 00:46:51,460
Isn't that Jiang Xueting?

623
00:46:51,460 --> 00:46:52,200
Yes, that's him.
